                "Plaster-Holt PH-8 kettle K-3 calcines stucco at 0.42 kg/s. Bed RTD 138 C sits 17 K "
                "under the 155 C over-calcine cap. Jacket dewpoint 4.2 C is condensate film, "
                "not a freeze. Bed-first ACCEPT keeps the charge; a dew-first abort would idle "
                "an in-spec calciner.",